OL,3,GFEATURES CRemembering the 1993 refresh
OL,4,Cof BBC One news branding
OL,5,
OL,6,FARCHIVE: The TV Room
OL,8,F13th April marked the 30th anniversary
OL,9,Fof one of the boldest revamps of BBC
OL,10,FNews.
OL,12,FA new look package put the BBC News
OL,13,Fbrand to the fore and made it clear
OL,14,Fthat all the main BBC One news
OL,15,Fprogrammes were part of the same
OL,16,Ffamily.
OL,18,FBut the package also allowed each
OL,19,Fprogramme to retain some of its own
OL,20,Fidentity ` unlike the next revamp six
OL,21,Fyears later.
OL,23,APub: 16-Apr-2023Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,139,120,200,300,0,100
