PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F138A1768760743
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G4/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CRemembering the 1993 refresh
OL,4,Cof BBC One news branding
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe relics of the 1981 look struggled
OL,7,Fon until 1988. Lambie Nairn's bold new
OL,8,Flook for the Nine was also adopted by
OL,9,Fthe weekend bulletins and became the
OL,10,Fnearest thing to a generic identity.
OL,12,FBut by the early 90s it was clear that
OL,13,Fthe emphasis had to be put on the BBC
OL,14,FNews brand.
OL,16,FThe new look did this.
OL,18,FAn impressive virtual reality set,
OL,19,Frearrangements by George Fenton of all
OL,20,Fthe news themes and a common graphics
OL,21,Fpackage were introduced.
OL,23,APub: 16-Apr-2023Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,139,120,200,300,0,100
PN,13805
SC,0005
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F138A1768760743
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G5/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CRemembering the 1993 refresh
OL,4,Cof BBC One news branding
OL,5,
OL,6,FBreakfast had a warm, pinkish glow. The
OL,7,FOne and the Six had slightly different
OL,8,Fblue backgrounds. The Nine had a
OL,9,Fparticularly impressive gold and dark
OL,10,Fblue set.
OL,12,FIt is interesting to review the package
OL,13,Fnow.
OL,15,FPersonally I always felt the BBC
OL,16,Fcorporate logo of the time looked
OL,17,Fbetter on screen when it was shown in a
OL,18,Fsingle colour ` as it was on the
OL,19,Fchannel idents.
OL,23,APub: 16-Apr-2023Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,139,120,200,300,0,100
PN,13806
