OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CRemembering the 1993 refresh
OL,4,Cof BBC One news branding
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn the BBC News and Sport titles the
OL,7,Ffull colour version was used which
OL,8,Falways tended to be a bit fussy.
OL,10,FThis was rectified when the new
OL,11,Fcorporate package was introduced in
OL,12,F1997.
OL,14,FThe looks of the programmes were all
OL,15,Fimpressive though ` including the
OL,16,Fseamless integration of the live shot
OL,17,Fof the presenter into the titles.
OL,19,FBut a couple of niggles.
OL,23,APub: 16-Apr-2023Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,139,120,200,300,0,100
