OL,3,GFEATURES CRemembering the 1993 refresh
OL,4,Cof BBC One news branding
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe rearranged signature tunes were so
OL,7,Fsimilar it might have been better to go
OL,8,Ffor just one.
OL,10,FSimilarly the set of the One had its
OL,11,Fown shade of blue with a vertical inset
OL,12,Fto the right of the screen.
OL,14,FThe Six and the daytime summaries
OL,15,Fshared the same package though ` a
OL,16,Fslightly different shade of blue and a
OL,17,Fhorizontal inset on the left.
OL,23,APub: 16-Apr-2023Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,139,120,200,300,0,100
PN,13808
SC,0008
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F138A1768760743
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G8/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CRemembering the 1993 refresh
OL,4,Cof BBC One news branding
OL,5,
OL,6,FDid any viewer with no interest in such
OL,7,Fthings notice? If you're going to do
OL,8,Fsomething different, at least make it
OL,9,Fmeaningful. The One would have been as
OL,10,Fwell to look just like the Six and the
OL,11,Fdaytime summaries.
OL,13,FInterestingly the One was the only
OL,14,Fprogramme to undergo any significant
OL,15,Feditorial or format changes in this
OL,16,Frelaunch.
OL,18,FJohn Tusa and Edward Stourton took over
OL,19,Ffrom previous presenter Philip Hayton
OL,20,Fand a significant emphasis was placed
OL,21,Fon foreign news.
OL,23,APub: 16-Apr-2023Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,139,120,200,300,0,100
