OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CRemembering the 1993 refresh
OL,4,Cof BBC One news branding
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn hindsight this was an unlikely
OL,7,Fdevelopment for a lunchtime programme
OL,8,Fshown between Pebble Mill in its chat
OL,9,Fshow incarnation and Neighbours but it
OL,10,Fspeaks of the BBC under John Birt.
OL,12,FAll in all, the look survived 6 years
OL,13,Falthough Breakfast got its own identity
OL,14,Fback earlier.
OL,16,FIt looks (and sounds) quite different
OL,17,Fto the BBC News package we have become
OL,18,Faccustomed to since 1999.
OL,20,FBut it was a successful and innovative
OL,21,Fpackage worth celebrating which should
OL,22,Fbe remembered positively.
OL,23,APub: 16-Apr-2023Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,139,120,200,300,0,100@
